        "created_at": "2014-12-23T17:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On Saturday, I gave my neice and nephews a copy of the core set for Hanukkah. &nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/SeeSome/status/546440618537672704\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">My daughter</a> and I had a great time <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RandiSumner/status/546444378886377472\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">teaching them the game</a>. &nbsp;Amusingly, the younger nephew, age 12, was continually asking about breaking the sturcture of the game and was fascinated with whether he could attack other heroes instead of the villain.</p>",
